  "usage": [
    "黑色 is a noun for the colour black, and it can stand alone as a description, like 呢個袋係黑色。",
    "You can put 黑色 before a noun to describe something, like 黑色衫好襯。",
    "黑色 is also used in everyday comparisons or preferences, like 我鍾意黑色多啲。",
    "When you want to say something is black in colour, use 係黑色 or 好黑色, like 佢對鞋係黑色。"
  ],
